description:
Design a two-input XOR gate using only NAND gates. The circuit takes two binary inputs, a and b, and produces an output y that is the logical XOR of the inputs. It achieves this by first computing the necessary intermediate values using NAND operations and then inverting the final output using a NAND gate to obtain the desired XOR behavior.
