Design a circuit that functions as a high-frequency signal modulator and demodulator. The module takes an 8-bit input signal and modulates it with an internal 8-bit data signal to create a combined high-frequency signal. It outputs the lower 8 bits of this high-frequency signal while also storing the upper 8 bits as data. Although the module has provisions for error checking and correction, these features are not implemented in the current design.
